  "title": "Agent Import Request",
  "description": "Body of POST /api/v1/projects/{project_id}/agents/import. Either the export wrapper {schema_version, agent} (what GET .../export returns; schema_version must be \"1.0\", `agent` carries the agent) or the direct agent format (`name` required, create-request properties). AgentImportService.validate_import accepts both and refuses a body with neither `agent` nor `name` (400 MISSING_REQUIRED_FIELD). That either-or rule is not expressed as a required set or anyOf because the breaking-change gate treats both as narrowing a request.",
